CTCL Project Based Interview Question
Q: Explain a Docker project you worked on.

Answer:

"I developed a CTCL Message Ratio Management Web Application using FastAPI and MySQL. I containerized both the FastAPI application and MySQL database using Docker and Docker Compose. The solution was deployed on AWS EC2. I configured Docker networking for inter-container communication, volumes for MySQL persistence, environment-based configuration using .env files, and implemented database backup/restore procedures using MySQL dump. This helped standardize deployments across local, UAT, and production environments while reducing setup and deployment effort significantly."
